Kh5 36. Rh8 Rxe6 37. Bxe6 Rc7 38. Bxf5 Rxc5 39. Be4 Nd5 40. gxh6 gxh6 41. Bf3+
Kg6 42. f5+ Kxf5 43. Rxh6 Nc3+ 44. Ke1 Rc8 45. Bg4+ Kg5 46. Bf4+ {Source(s):
Evening Herald, February 5, 1949, p. 4. via irlchess.com} 1-0

